# Whitelist: images are built from these paths only. Everything else stays out of the build
# context: .env and its keys, contracts/ (a 215 MB submodule), deployment secrets.
*
!package.json
!package-lock.json
!packages/
!apps/
!server/
!demo/
!deployments/sepolia.json
!hosting/*.conf
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.wrangler
**/.env
**/.DS_Store
!hosting/*.inc
